WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,730
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,535 --> 00:00:05,385
This is Episode 41.

3
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,970
Lulu has a shiny badge today.

4
00:00:08,774 --> 00:00:10,414
She zips up to the blue door.

5
00:00:11,219 --> 00:00:12,169
It stays shut.

6
00:00:12,974 --> 00:00:13,654
Oh no!

7
00:00:14,459 --> 00:00:15,619
Maya looks closer.

8
00:00:16,424 --> 00:00:17,664
Every door has a list.

9
00:00:18,468 --> 00:00:19,628
Green means may.

10
00:00:20,433 --> 00:00:21,643
Red means may not.

11
00:00:22,448 --> 00:00:24,088
The blue door says may not.

12
00:00:24,893 --> 00:00:26,383
The badge does not matter.

13
00:00:27,188 --> 00:00:28,728
Lulu zips to the yellow door.

14
00:00:29,532 --> 00:00:30,152
Green!

15
00:00:30,957 --> 00:00:31,997
It swings open.

16
00:00:32,802 --> 00:00:35,232
The green door has a green line and a red line.

17
00:00:36,037 --> 00:00:36,967
Which one wins?

18
00:00:37,772 --> 00:00:38,322
Red.

19
00:00:39,126 --> 00:00:40,536
May-not always wins.

20
00:00:41,341 --> 00:00:42,611
The door stays shut.

21
00:00:43,416 --> 00:00:45,896
Lulu shrugs and zips back through the yellow door.

22
00:00:46,701 --> 00:00:47,721
Right doors open.

23
00:00:48,526 --> 00:00:49,866
Wrong doors stay shut.

24
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:51,800
That is the door list.

25
00:00:52,605 --> 00:00:54,605
Now you know IAM policies!

26
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
